      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.71,
          "end": 5.15,
          "en": "So now we know how to build our Vue app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.15,
          "end": 8.1,
          "en": "how to output content or bind attributes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.1,
          "end": 11.88,
          "en": "And then we can either set up some data in data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.88,
          "end": 15.005,
          "en": "and refer to that in our HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.005,
          "end": 18.033,
          "en": "or then we can also define methods which are called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.64,
          "end": 21.44,
          "en": "It really depends on what you're building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.44,
          "end": 23.923,
          "en": "and what your application goal is in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.87,
          "end": 27.794,
          "en": "Now, before we practice those first important concepts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.794,
          "end": 31.24,
          "en": "there are a couple of other things you should know about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.24,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "Vue and how to work with its data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 37.01,
          "en": "For example, let's say we have our courseGoals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.01,
          "end": 39.35,
          "en": "stored in data properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.35,
          "end": 42.16,
          "en": "We've got our coarseGoalA here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.16,
          "end": 44.93,
          "en": "and we got our coarseGoalB here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.93,
          "end": 48.68,
          "en": "Master Vue and build amazing apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.68,
          "end": 51.53,
          "en": "So, we got our two different goals here now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.53,
          "end": 54.89,
          "en": "And instead of returning hardcoded strings here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.89,
          "end": 59.22,
          "en": "in outputGoal, I wanna output one of these two Goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.22,
          "end": 61.56,
          "en": "which are defined in data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.56,
          "end": 63.38,
          "en": "This is very easy to do in Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.38,
          "end": 66.79,
          "en": "but it uses a special feature or a syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.79,
          "end": 68.94,
          "en": "which you should be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.94,
          "end": 71.22,
          "en": "Let's say here, if the random number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.22,
          "end": 75.843,
          "en": "is smaller than dot five, I wanna return courseGoalA.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.86,
          "end": 80.57,
          "en": "Now we can't just write courseGoalA here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.57,
          "end": 83.21000000000001,
          "en": "This would not be valid JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.21000000000001,
          "end": 85.87,
          "en": "With this code, JavaScript would look for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.87,
          "end": 89.568,
          "en": "a courseGoalA variable or constant, which it wouldn't find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.568,
          "end": 93.87,
          "en": "because here courseGoalA is not a variable or constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.87,
          "end": 95.793,
          "en": "it's a property of this object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.2,
          "end": 98.78,
          "en": "But instead we can use a syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.78,
          "end": 102.83,
          "en": "which you probably wouldn't think that it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.83,
          "end": 105.313,
          "en": "You can use this.courseGoalA.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.22999999999999,
          "end": 109.27000000000001,
          "en": "Now, depending on your level of JavaScript knowledge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.27000000000001,
          "end": 111.39,
          "en": "this might look very strange.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.39,
          "end": 114.96000000000001,
          "en": "The this keyword is a core keyword in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.96000000000001,
          "end": 118.03,
          "en": "and it can be tricky, but in this context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.03,
          "end": 122.26,
          "en": "this should not refer to this object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.26,
          "end": 124.04,
          "en": "It should refer to something else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.04,
          "end": 129.04,
          "en": "And it normally would, but Vue does some magic here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.24,
          "end": 132.82,
          "en": "It basically takes all the data you return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.82,
          "end": 136.738,
          "en": "in this data object, which you return the data method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.738,
          "end": 141.738,
          "en": "and it merges it into a global Vue instance object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.5,
          "end": 145.743,
          "en": "So into your Vue app object, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 147.47,
          "end": 150.81,
          "en": "So, these three data properties are available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.81,
          "end": 154.453,
          "en": "in a behind the scenes managed Vue app object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.3,
          "end": 158.76,
          "en": "Your methods are also available there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.76,
          "end": 161.55,
          "en": "And they do have access to anything stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.55,
          "end": 165.25,
          "en": "in that global object through the this keyword.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165.25,
          "end": 169.92000000000002,
          "en": "And that's why in this custom method inside of methods,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.92000000000002,
          "end": 174.263,
          "en": "we can use this to refer for example, to our data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.22,
          "end": 179.163,
          "en": "So, we can do this here as well, this.courseGoalB.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 181.636,
          "end": 182.98,
          "en": "And if I saved it and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 182.98,
          "end": 185.91,
          "en": "we therefore now output these different course goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 185.91,
          "end": 189.593,
          "en": "which are stored in our data with help of this method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 190.81,
          "end": 193.52,
          "en": "And having that knowledge of the this keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.52,
          "end": 196.15,
          "en": "and what it refers to inside of your methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 196.15,
          "end": 198.38,
          "en": "in your Vue app, that's important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 198.38,
          "end": 200.31,
          "en": "because we're going to work with that a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.31,
          "end": 201.46,
          "en": "throughout this course.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
